#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:2 f019209cf65841b99a4f0089485e8068
msgid "_`What this library does not do`"
msgstr ""
"_`本库不做什么`"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:4 d270d377174b45129af2dc92e34f725b
msgid ""
"Every row below is a limit that will cost somebody a day if they meet it "
"in the field instead of here. The point of the page is not humility: a "
"control library whose boundaries are unstated gets used outside them, and"
" the failure then looks like a bug in the library rather than a fact "
"about the domain."
msgstr ""
"下面每一行都是一条限制：在现场而不是在这里撞上，就要搭进去一天。本页的要"
"点不是谦逊：边界没有写明的控制库会被用在边界之外，而那时的故障看起来像库"
"里的缺陷，而不像这个领域本身的一条事实。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:8 1a8717c3b60c4b6e8b38f0c513cc403a
msgid ""
"This page is about what the *library* cannot do. It is a different list "
"from :ref:`honest limits <honest-limits>`, which is about what software "
"verification cannot reach and is deferred to hardware -- dead-time, ADC "
"timing, EMI, ISR worst case. Both are needed: one is a property of the "
"method, the other of the evidence."
msgstr ""
"本页说的是 *库* 做不到的事。这份清单与 :ref:`诚实边界 <honest-limits>` "
"不同，那一份说的是软件验证够不到、要交回硬件的事——死区、ADC 时序、EMI、"
"中断服务程序的最坏情形。两份都需要：一份是方法的性质，另一份是证据的性质"
"。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:12 8925b4429125452cb417a4443ebbbb13
msgid ""
"Each row names the case that **pins** it, and the `boundaries` gate "
"checks that every named case still exists. A statement whose case was "
"renamed or deleted therefore fails the build rather than quietly becoming"
" folklore. That is the only reason this page can be trusted after the "
"person who wrote it has moved on."
msgstr ""
"每一行都点名把它 **钉住** 的用例， `boundaries` 门禁则检查每个被点名的用"
"例是否仍然存在。因此，用例被改名或删除的陈述会让构建失败，而不是悄悄变成"
"口耳相传的说法。这也是写下本页的人离开之后，本页仍可被信任的唯一理由。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:20 3ee5077da550459bb0056963a466dbd0
msgid "What it cannot do"
msgstr ""
"做不到的事"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:21 cc1117db861140289edd3d85fa3b103b
msgid "What that means for you"
msgstr ""
"对你的含义"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:22 ebf9651e63c74a329a550189c8f0e705
msgid "Pinned by"
msgstr ""
"钉住它的用例"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:23 c88dc2023f9b43f789364bd9bd4027e0
msgid "**Resolve the magnet polarity.**"
msgstr ""
"**分辨磁极极性。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:24 9e0b341957d04649ab844d78fc442de8
msgid ""
"The injection observer converges to `dtheta = pi` as happily as to zero: "
"the d axis is right and the magnet is backwards, so the torque sign is "
"inverted. Telling them apart needs a separate pulse or saturation test, "
"which is `MagnetPolarityTest` applied once at commissioning -- not "
"something the observer does for you."
msgstr ""
"注入观测器收敛到 `dtheta = pi` 与收敛到零一样干脆：d 轴是对的，磁体却是"
"反的，转矩符号因此反号。要区分这两种情形，需要单独的脉冲试验或饱和试验，"
"也就是投运调试时做一次的 `MagnetPolarityTest` ——并非观测器会代为完成的事"
"。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:27 ed48e2d840a54259b372bc5289d1885e
msgid "``SilHfi.OutsideTheHalfTurnWindowItLocksToTheMirror``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SilHfi.OutsideTheHalfTurnWindowItLocksToTheMirror``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:28 7f923e6e65c842cea86862e3590064a1
msgid "**Survive a wrong saliency sign.**"
msgstr ""
"**承受凸极符号取反。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:29 a8a08d5f6c1245b8a143f4d142b45f3d
msgid ""
"A machine with `Ld > Lq` needs `demod_gain_a` positive; the wrong sign "
"does not give a worse estimate, it drives the estimate to the unstable "
"equilibrium at `+-pi/2` and leaves it there."
msgstr ""
"`Ld > Lq` 的电机需要 `demod_gain_a` 为正；符号取错不会只让估计变差，而是"
"把估计推到 `+-pi/2` 处的不稳定平衡点，并让它停在那里。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:31 061b4503244d44f3a342f557a4a525bc
msgid "``SilHfi.AWrongSaliencyDirectionRunsAwayInsteadOfLocking``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SilHfi.AWrongSaliencyDirectionRunsAwayInsteadOfLocking``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:32 76d143d678ff4520bed7f7a45b280d4e
msgid "**Say \"I do not know\" through `ObsState`.**"
msgstr ""
"**通过 `ObsState` 说出“不知道”。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:33 2acafae1cad34e5cb04f48d6126bf190
msgid ""
"The angle has no validity channel. An observer that is not measuring "
"holds its last angle and reports zero speed -- indistinguishable from a "
"stopped machine by those two numbers alone. Use `locked()` (or "
"`status()[\"observer_locked\"]` from Python) to tell them apart."
msgstr ""
"角度没有有效性通道。没有在测量的观测器会保持上一个角度并报告零转速——仅凭"
"这两个数，它与停转的电机无法区分。要区分二者，用 `locked()` （或从"
"Python读 `status()[\"observer_locked\"]` ）。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:36 85fb75b2b3f24b2697ec13b976cd91b0
msgid "``SwitchableObserver.TheSelectedObserversLockVerdictIsReachableThroughTheSlot``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"SwitchableObserver.TheSelectedObserversLockVerdictIsReachableThroughTheSlot"
"``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:37 c44d9a1b77f3430ea9bb4a4bc7598368
msgid "**Run an injection carrier the control rate cannot resolve.**"
msgstr ""
"**使用控制频率分辨不了的注入载波。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:38 1e1640a5b6f2492c8ae154481a921aae
msgid ""
"Past `hfi_max_inject_hz(control_hz)` the observer stops: the demodulated "
"amplitude collapses, the lock drops out, the angle freezes, the speed "
"reads zero, and a loop closing on it runs away (measured: -19.5 rad/s of "
"speed bias). The request is refused at setup, and by `update()` for the "
"paths that do not go through the bridge."
msgstr ""
"超过 `hfi_max_inject_hz(control_hz)` 之后观测器就停了：解调幅值塌掉，锁"
"定丢失，角度冻结，转速读为零，闭合其上的环会跑飞（实测：转速偏置 -19.5"
"rad/s）。该请求在配置阶段即被拒绝；不走那座桥的路径则由 `update()` 拒绝"
"。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:41 bdd69d3c038941198acf8793d2c6eb0a
msgid "``HfiObserver.ACarrierThisControlRateCannotResolveIsRefusedNotFrozen``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"HfiObserver.ACarrierThisControlRateCannotResolveIsRefusedNotFrozen``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:42 8fc87ad549e545f0a7f0bd7aac5b9e9a
msgid "**Use one carrier frequency at every control rate.**"
msgstr ""
"**在各个控制频率上共用同一个载波频率。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:43 1efea181645a443aad311e67b76a155c
msgid ""
"The ceiling is a sampling fact, not a machine fact: 9200 Hz is refused at"
" 20 kHz and accepted at 40 kHz. Sizing a carrier for one rate and reusing"
" it at another is the mistake this row exists to prevent."
msgstr ""
"这个上限是采样的事实，不是电机的事实：9200 Hz 在 20 kHz 下被拒绝，在 40"
"kHz 下被接受。按一种频率选定载波、再拿到另一种频率上复用，正是本行要防的"
"错误。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:45 96596ac4b1f542dfaa5d84bad269b484
msgid "``HfiObserver.TheCarrierCeilingScalesWithTheControlRate``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``HfiObserver.TheCarrierCeilingScalesWithTheControlRate``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:46 11083ca4995440c998324868ea0bc309
msgid "**Run the injection observer on a surface machine.**"
msgstr ""
"**在表贴式电机上运行注入观测器。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:47 c53286feee8c41309dbf13c2e6964c50
msgid ""
"`predicted_gain_a()` is proportional to `(lq - ld)`, so with `lq == ld` "
"the demodulated signal is identically zero and no follower can lock. The "
"mode is refused rather than admitted and left to fail later."
msgstr ""
"`predicted_gain_a()` 与 `(lq - ld)` 成正比，所以在 `lq == ld` 时解调信号"
"恒为零，任何跟随器都无法锁定。该模式被拒绝，而不是先放行、留到后面再失败"
"。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:49 75be249521b949108a52f63cb34e98ad
msgid "``ApiObserverSelector.TheHfiModeRefusesWithoutACarrierOrWithoutSaliency``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"ApiObserverSelector.TheHfiModeRefusesWithoutACarrierOrWithoutSaliency``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:50 83279014e0ee4e368e0bd1736325e688
msgid "**Acquire a rotor that is already turning.**"
msgstr ""
"**捕获已经在转动的转子。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:51 77428be5744c44dfaa5c700a32a6d6fe
msgid ""
"The loop pulls the angle only inside `+-pi/2` and has no way to pull a "
"frequency it has never seen. A rotor handed to it mid-spin either gets "
"caught or lands on the mirror, and which one is a property of the speed. "
"A hand-over must seed it (`seed_angle`), which is what the blending "
"observer does while the carrier is wound down."
msgstr ""
"这个环只在 `+-pi/2` 之内拉角度，对从未见过的频率无从拉取。把正在旋转的转"
"子交给它，结果要么被捕获，要么落到镜像点上，哪一种取决于转速。交接时必须"
"给它种子（ `seed_angle` ），混合观测器在载波逐步撤掉的过程中做的正是这件"
"事。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:54 7dff43af8a43489e9701ec0b38ec307d
msgid "``SilHfiEnvelope.AcquiringARotorAlreadyRunningNeedsASeed``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SilHfiEnvelope.AcquiringARotorAlreadyRunningNeedsASeed``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:55 b5e784e176724d4aa2bf3a42dbf228f9
msgid "**Reduce the low-speed servo's residual ripple by improving the angle.**"
msgstr ""
"**靠改善角度来降低低速伺服的残余纹波。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:56 f56cadbdbdfd49bb8618ca6f85532750
msgid ""
"The steady bias at 20 rad/s is 0.0039 rad/s (0.02 %); what remains is a "
"ripple at the carrier frequency, and it is the injected current cross-"
"coupling into torque on a turning machine -- linear in `inject_v` and in "
"speed, indifferent to the saliency. Improving the angle by 13x does not "
"move it. `inject_v` is the knob."
msgstr ""
"20 rad/s 处的稳态偏置是 0.0039 rad/s（0.02 %）；剩下的是载波频率上的纹波"
"，它是注入电流在旋转电机上耦合进转矩的产物——与 `inject_v` 和转速都成线性"
"，与凸极性无关。把角度改善 13 倍并不能让它移动。可调的是 `inject_v` 。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:59 eb60993261b74d34811adea2f1074a14
msgid "``SilSpeedRipple.TheFigureSurvivesSubstepResolution``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``SilSpeedRipple.TheFigureSurvivesSubstepResolution``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:60 fdd01a29150f475490714848f93eb331
msgid "**Reconstruct what the hardware actually did from a trace.**"
msgstr ""
"**从轨迹重建硬件实际做了什么。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:61 1e48f3b6092b4087baf0a75efc1c9950
msgid ""
"The trace records what the loop *believed*: the currents the PI acted on "
"and the voltages it applied before modulation. A trace that looks perfect"
" is therefore entirely consistent with a miscalibrated current sensor -- "
"the loop is faithful to a wrong measurement. Use it to explain the loop's"
" decisions, not to measure the phases."
msgstr ""
"轨迹记录的是环 *相信* 的东西：PI 作用其上的电流，以及它在调制之前施加的"
"电压。因此一条看起来完美的轨迹与一个标定错误的电流传感器完全相容——环忠实"
"于一个错误的测量。用它来解释环的决定，不要用它去测相电流。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:64 c1052550d12248bfab4acfa43a6a50e5
msgid "``Trace.TheRecordAgreesWithTheScalarReadBitForBit``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``Trace.TheRecordAgreesWithTheScalarReadBitForBit``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:65 73904df05bcf4d0ea970a9b6dc8b5e0f
msgid "**Start a load the drive cannot move.**"
msgstr ""
"**起动驱动器带不动的负载。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:66 f1dfeb8597024999ad6c4d24de964f22
msgid ""
"The sequence ramps to its limit, holds, and after its grace period "
"reports `Failed` with zero torque: measured 0.200 N*m at 0.5 N*m/s "
"reached at 400 ms, then a 200 ms grace. It cannot conjure torque -- the "
"only honest answers are \"released\" and \"cannot start\", and from "
"outside a silent axis is indistinguishable from a working one, which is "
"why the failure is a state rather than an absence."
msgstr ""
"该序列斜坡到自己的限值后保持，宽限期过后报告 `Failed` 且转矩为零：实测以"
"0.5 N *m/s 的斜率在 400 ms 到达 0.200 N* m，随后是 200 ms 宽限。它无法凭"
"空生出转矩——诚实的答案只有“已释放”和“无法起动”，而从外部看，一条沉默的轴"
"与一条正常工作的轴无法区分，这正是失败被做成一个状态、而不是一种缺失的原"
"因。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:70 3222039d10794befa3bcf0d9a5310496
msgid "``StallStart.AStuckAxisSaysFailedInsteadOfRampingForever``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``StallStart.AStuckAxisSaysFailedInsteadOfRampingForever``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:71 075f5214b23d42778746dc6a7ad8508c
msgid "**See a fault code while the drive is derating.**"
msgstr ""
"**在驱动器降额期间看到故障码。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:72 9e44ae2d99274f60b91b264bf5bc6215
msgid ""
"A hot machine below the trip temperature reports `fault = None` and "
"`active_mask = 0` while its current limit is already falling -- measured:"
" 3.00 A at 45 C, 1.80 A at 80 C, both with output allowed, then 0 A and "
"no output at 105 C. `output_allowed` is defined as `active_mask == 0`, so"
" a fault means \"authority removed\" and derating is not one: read "
"`i_limit_a` against the `i_max_a` you configured if you want to know the "
"machine is hot. A commissioning tool that shows only the fault code will "
"report a derating drive as healthy."
msgstr ""
"热态但低于跳闸温度的电机报告 `fault = None` 与 `active_mask = 0` ，而它"
"的电流限值已经在下降——实测：45 C 时 3.00 A，80 C 时 1.80 A，两者都允许输"
"出；105 C 时 0 A 且无输出。 `output_allowed` 定义为 `active_mask == 0` "
"，所以故障的含义是“权限被收回”，降额不算：要知道电机是否已热，应当拿 `"
"i_limit_a` 与你配置的 `i_max_a` 比较。只显示故障码的投运调试工具会把一台"
"正在降额的驱动器报成健康。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:77 3c42f55cb1fa4cdcbc787ee98ad12a47
msgid "``Protection.TheTemperatureLadderIsGradedRatherThanACliff``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``Protection.TheTemperatureLadderIsGradedRatherThanACliff``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:78 2ecde18b35f24b7692b0a00accdbcce7
msgid "**Estimate a torque that accounts for iron loss or magnet temperature.**"
msgstr ""
"**估计出计入铁耗或磁体温度的转矩。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:79 4c8574e1aed94e8298d778bfdb59a7b8
msgid ""
"`torque_estimate()` is `kt*iq + 1.5*pp*(ld-lq)*id*iq`, and `kt` is a "
"nameplate number: it does not know that the magnet weakens as it heats, "
"that iron loss subtracts torque at speed, or that the inverter adds no "
"torque. The 5 % agreement it reports is against the same model the plant "
"integrates, so it is an agreement about the *model*, not a claim about a "
"hot machine."
msgstr ""
"`torque_estimate()` 是 `kt*iq + 1.5*pp*(ld-lq)*id*iq` ，而 `kt` 是一个铭"
"牌数：它不知道磁体受热会变弱，不知道铁耗在高速下会扣掉转矩，也不知道逆变"
"器不产生转矩。它报告的 5 % 吻合是对着被控对象所积分的同一个模型量的，所"
"以那是关于 *模型* 的吻合，不是关于一台热态电机的断言。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:83 5a92b5f6b79545079f27c671ac944210
msgid "``TorqueMap.TheEstimateMatchesTheMechanicsOfTheSilBench``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``TorqueMap.TheEstimateMatchesTheMechanicsOfTheSilBench``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:84 b6f58ed2e5374947a477a1d00ed3b818
msgid "**Improve a sensored axis's angle by adding the carrier.**"
msgstr ""
"**靠加入载波来改善有传感器轴的角度。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:85 81587c5923fe419ca551e804a7209feb
msgid ""
"The sensor owns the commutation angle, so the injection observer now runs"
" for its own demodulation only: the carrier does reach the inverter "
"(measured swing 0.45--0.67 across eight rate/PWM combinations), but the "
"sensor keeps the angle and the published speed. `status()[\"observer\"]` "
"naming `HFI` therefore does *not* mean the loop is commutating on the "
"injected estimate -- compare the two explicitly if that is what you need."
msgstr ""
"传感器掌握换向角，所以注入观测器此时只为自己的解调而运行：载波确实到了逆"
"变器（实测八种频率/PWM 组合下摆幅 0.45--0.67），但角度与对外发布的转速仍"
"归传感器。因此 `status()[\"observer\"]` 写着 `HFI` 并 *不* 意味着环在用"
"注入法得到的估计换向——若需要判断这一点，把两者显式对比。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:89 455af697adbd4e818cdb2cd7b78233ae
msgid "``MotorInjection.ASensoredAxisInjectsWithoutSurrenderingTheAngle``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``MotorInjection.ASensoredAxisInjectsWithoutSurrenderingTheAngle``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:90 952e3a9a5fd5415fa59d3a9475c362a7
msgid "**Get a quiet speed estimate out of the injection observer for free.**"
msgstr ""
"**不付代价地从注入观测器取得干净的转速估计。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:91 40248d98b2b14a229ce46c84554f56bf
msgid ""
"`omega_e = omega_int + kp*error`, and `error` carries the carrier, so the"
" published speed holds 0.4180 rad/s at 2000 Hz in a 20 rad/s servo unless"
" `speed_lpf_hz` is set. The library's own path sets it (200 Hz); a caller"
" that constructs the observer directly gets the raw value."
msgstr ""
"`omega_e = omega_int + kp*error` ，而 `error` 里带着载波，所以在 20"
"rad/s的伺服里，除非设置 `speed_lpf_hz` ，对外发布的转速在 2000 Hz 上保持"
"在0.4180 rad/s。库自己的路径会设置它（200 Hz）；直接构造观测器的调用方拿"
"到的是原始值。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:94 1e745ac5d7d54441806d50cb5b63fa61
msgid "``SilSpeedRipple.ThePublishedSpeedCanBeCleanedAndTheRotorDoesNotCare``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"SilSpeedRipple.ThePublishedSpeedCanBeCleanedAndTheRotorDoesNotCare``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:95 ebcc5561062c447dbd2e294cc22f5aab
msgid "**Close a servo on a ten-millisecond-old speed.**"
msgstr ""
"**用十毫秒之前的转速闭合伺服。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:96 96eca7272bcc4f3abbf51527a35b3918
msgid ""
"Differencing the angle is quieter than the PLL and worse in a loop: at a "
"200 rad/s speed-loop bandwidth the window is transport delay in the "
"feedback path, and no window length from 500 us to 10 ms wins on both "
"settled accuracy and peak. The route is closed by measurement, not by "
"taste."
msgstr ""
"对角度做差分比 PLL 更安静，放进环里却更差：在 200 rad/s 的速度环带宽下，"
"这个窗口就是反馈通路里的传输延迟，而从 500 us 到 10 ms 之间没有任何窗口"
"长度能在稳态精度和峰值上同时胜出。这条路是被测量关掉的，不是被偏好关掉的"
"。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:99 daa26eb22d654b1985041b369219dda2
msgid "``SilSpeedFromAngleClosedLoop.AWindowShortEnoughToBeOnTimeIsTheOnlyWayThisRouteWins``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"SilSpeedFromAngleClosedLoop.AWindowShortEnoughToBeOnTimeIsTheOnlyWayThisRouteWins"
"``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:100 4bfb023737f743fda45b5b938c93f1ff
msgid "**Get a rotor angle out of three Hall sensors alone.**"
msgstr ""
"**只靠三个霍尔传感器取得转子角度。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:101 a23f983f432645f3b5a44c8b8ece2b95
msgid ""
"The code carries 60 degrees of information per edge and *nothing* inside "
"a sector: two angles 59.96 degrees apart read the same code, so a decoder"
" that sees only the code is wrong by up to 30 degrees -- worst case, half"
" a sector, and no cleverness improves it. Ten degrees of mounting error "
"on one sensor widens the bound to 35 and narrows the other sectors to 25 "
"without ever producing an illegal code, so misplacement is invisible to "
"the wiring. Everything finer than 60 degrees has to come from edge "
"*timing*, which is the decoder's work, not the sensor's."
msgstr ""
"码值在每次跳变上携带 60 度的信息，扇区内部则 *什么都没有* ：相差 59.96"
"度的两个角度读出同一个码，所以只看码值的解码器误差最大可达 30 度——最坏情"
"形是半个扇区，再聪明也无法改善。某个传感器十度的安装误差会把这一上界放宽"
"到35 度，同时把其余扇区压到 25 度，而且始终不产生非法码，因此装错位置对"
"连线是隐形的。比 60 度更细的一切都只能来自跳变的 *时刻* ，那是解码器的工"
"作，不是传感器的工作。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:107 eb9b3f112c304f2a891924d0232fe2b8
msgid "``HallPhysics.InsideOneSectorTheCodeCarriesNoAngleInformation``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``HallPhysics.InsideOneSectorTheCodeCarriesNoAngleInformation``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:108 d523e2d759a54d2181a73fa660f60451
msgid "**See a dead Hall sensor all the time.**"
msgstr ""
"**在任何时刻都能看出霍尔传感器损坏。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:109 b6032a4709a64a1c80a131682048e0f7
msgid ""
"A stuck sensor freezes its bit: one sixth of a revolution reads as the "
"illegal code 0 or 7 (that is the entire visible fault) and the other five"
" sixths read as perfectly legal codes at 120-degree resolution, with the "
"edge interval doubled. Worse, every surviving transition still flips "
"exactly one bit, so the adjacency check that most decoders carry never "
"fires -- measured, not assumed, and the first version of that case "
"asserted the opposite. Anything built on Halls must watch the illegal "
"window *and* the edge timing; either alone has a blind spot."
msgstr ""
"卡住的传感器把它的位冻结：六分之一圈读成非法码 0 或 7（这就是全部可见的"
"故障），另外六分之五圈读成完全合法的码、分辨率为 120 度，且跳变间隔加倍"
"。更糟的是，每一次幸存的跳变仍然只翻转一个位，因此多数解码器带的相邻性检"
"查永远不会触发——这是量出来的，不是假定的，而这个用例的第一版断言的恰好相"
"反。建在霍尔上的任何东西都必须同时看非法窗口 *和* 跳变时刻；只看其中一个"
"都有盲区。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:114 303ef5de216e477b8ca00a6d69b3bbab
msgid "``HallPhysics.ADeadSensorIsSilentForFiveSixthsOfTheRevolutionAndKeepsEveryRemainingCodeLegal``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"HallPhysics.ADeadSensorIsSilentForFiveSixthsOfTheRevolutionAndKeepsEveryRemainingCodeLegal"
"``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:115 2865bceb769b40a2bf20f65a8e5c1a06
msgid "**Declare a dead Hall sensor over the whole revolution.**"
msgstr ""
"**在整个一圈上都宣告霍尔传感器损坏。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:116 bd02ab93a88c4463b28c03afce1d800b
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Both channels together still leave **8.4 % of a revolution reading `Ok` "
"while wrong by up to 59 degrees** (13.7 % and 120 degrees with the sensor"
" stuck high): the illegal window is 15.5 % and the interval check another"
" 53.9 %, so roughly a third of every revolution is undeclared. A drive "
"built on Halls needs a second opinion -- current or torque sanity, an "
"index, anything independent of the codes -- rather than a cleverer check "
"on the codes. This is the number that decides how the fault has to be "
"handled, and it is asserted so it cannot quietly become \"the fault is "
"caught\"."
msgstr ""
"两条通道合起来，仍然有 **一圈中 8.4 % 的读数报 `Ok` 而实际偏差最大达 59"
"度** （传感器卡在高电平时是 13.7 % 与 120 度）：非法窗口占 15.5 %，间隔"
"检查再占 53.9 %，因此每圈大约三分之一是未宣告的。建在霍尔上的驱动器需要"
"第二个意见——电流或转矩是否合理、一个索引信号、任何与码值无关的东西——而不"
"是对码值做更聪明的检查。决定这条故障必须怎么处理的正是这个数，它被断言下"
"来，就不能悄悄变成“故障已被捕获”。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:122 93bb51c1010c47408ed4d1848196cbe0
msgid "``HallTracker.AStuckSensorIsCoveredByTwoChannelsAndNeitherAloneIsEnough``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"HallTracker.AStuckSensorIsCoveredByTwoChannelsAndNeitherAloneIsEnough``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:123 61ac2a88ffe9486c9ef856c0ab08f1f8
msgid "**Cancel friction you have not measured.**"
msgstr ""
"**抵消没有测量过的摩擦。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:124 ed4d582daa644c20b7f68666fc421644
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The compensation is a torque of its own, so an estimate above the "
"machine's breakaway moves the rotor even when the reference is held still"
" -- measured, **5.625 mrad of travel with no command at all** from a "
"`(0.030, 0.030)` estimate on a machine whose breakaway is 0.020. Below "
"the breakaway it is safe but it takes the residual with it: `(static - "
"coulomb)/kp` follows the estimate wherever it goes, 2.021 mrad at the "
"true value and 1.007 at a 50 % over-estimate. There is nothing in the "
"code stream that can tell you the estimate is wrong -- it has to come "
"from a measurement, and the boundary of \"good enough\" is the breakaway."
msgstr ""
"这个补偿本身就是一份转矩，所以高于脱开点的估计值即使参考保持不变也会让转"
"子移动——实测：在脱开点为 0.020 的电机上，用 `(0.030, 0.030)` 的估计，在"
"完全没有指令的情况下走出 **5.625 mrad** 。低于脱开点时它是安全的，但会把"
"残差一起带走： `(static - coulomb)/kp` 跟着估计值走到哪算到哪，真值处是"
"2.021 mrad，高估 50 % 时是 1.007。代码流里没有任何东西能告诉你估计错了——"
"它只能来自测量，而“够用”的边界就是脱开点。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:130 0723aedff78d429c94e95ef5ee76754d
msgid "``FrictionComp.AnEstimateAboveTheBreakawayWalksTheAxisWithNoCommandAtAll``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"FrictionComp.AnEstimateAboveTheBreakawayWalksTheAxisWithNoCommandAtAll``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:131 6d04b27b3f6342d8a69b31ce9fbc4803
msgid "**Tell a stalled axis from a friction estimate that is too low.**"
msgstr ""
"**区分卡住的轴与过低的摩擦估计。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:132 74b40bf91dbc425dbde4e9d39e58825b
msgid ""
"Both read as \"at rest while the loop asks for more than the estimate\", "
"which is exactly what `stalled` reports, so the flag is honest about "
"being one fact and not a diagnosis. Distinguishing them needs a second "
"signal -- a torque measurement, an encoder that is not moving, or a "
"command that would obviously move a healthy axis."
msgstr ""
"两者都读作“静止，而环要求的量超过了估计值”，这正是 `stalled` 报告的内容"
"，所以这个标志诚实地只表示一条事实，而不是一个诊断。区分它们需要第二个信"
"号——一次转矩测量、一个不动的编码器，或者一条明显能带动健康轴的指令。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:135 1f1df6c77350435d9afc26f14a2e502f
msgid "``FrictionComp.TheStallFlagNeedsBothStillnessAndADemandAboveTheBreakaway``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"FrictionComp.TheStallFlagNeedsBothStillnessAndADemandAboveTheBreakaway``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:136 ba5d2477a387496684f517094b1f34cb
msgid "**Stop an axis at a wall without knowing the drive's delay.**"
msgstr ""
"**在不知道驱动器时延的情况下把轴停在墙前。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:137 928db33e3a3d4cc898dfdc771275ab69
msgid ""
"The velocity ceiling is `v^2 <= 2*a*(d - v*dt)` and `dt` is the drive's "
"own latency, not the control period: on the SIL axis it is about 1 ms "
"(one period plus the 0.8 ms current rise). Assuming it is zero -- the "
"natural reading of \"it can decelerate at `a`\" -- crosses the wall by "
"**19 mm at 20 rad/s**, which is exactly `v*dt`; with it the axis stops "
"**1.04 mm short**. It cannot be derived from anything in the library, so "
"it has to come from a commissioning run or a datasheet, and the number "
"passed in should be the conservative one."
msgstr ""
"速度上限是 `v^2 <= 2*a*(d - v*dt)` ，其中的 `dt` 是驱动器自身的时延，不"
"是控制周期：在 SIL 轴上是约 1 ms（一个周期加上 0.8 ms 的电流建立时间）。"
"把它当成零——也就是“它能以 `a` 减速”这一说法的自然读法——会 **在 20 rad/s"
"下越墙 19 mm** ，这恰好等于 `v*dt` ；计入它，轴停在 **差 1.04 mm** 处。"
"它无法从库里的任何东西推导出来，只能来自一次投运调试或一份数据手册，传进"
"来的数应当取保守的那个。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:142 73599f41b3e44833a870291bfbabd923
msgid "``SoftLimit.TheDelayTermIsTheDifferenceBetweenNineteenMillimetresPastAndOneShort``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"SoftLimit.TheDelayTermIsTheDifferenceBetweenNineteenMillimetresPastAndOneShort"
"``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:143 6412dd6ecd6f4958bab1430b293c11a5
msgid "**Synchronise two axes with a position-only gear.**"
msgstr ""
"**用只输出位置的齿轮同步两根轴。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:144 326fc1b8510343ffbb40cd5d7aeada61
msgid ""
"A perfectly geared pair still shows a standing error of `v*kd/kp` -- "
"**25.6 mrad** at 10 rad/s with `kd` 0.02 and `kp` 8 -- because a position"
" loop following a moving reference always lags it. It scales with the "
"rate and inversely with the gain, so raising `kp` buys accuracy at the "
"price of stability, and the only term that removes it is the gear's "
"velocity output fed forward as `+kd*v_ref`. A gear that emits only a "
"position is a lag generator with a ratio."
msgstr ""
"一对齿轮比完美的轴仍然带着 `v*kd/kp` 的稳态误差——10 rad/s 下 `kd` 为0.02"
"、 `kp` 为 8 时是 **25.6 mrad** ——因为跟踪移动参考的位置环总是滞后于它。"
"它随速度成比例增长、随增益成反比缩小，所以提高 `kp` 是用稳定性换精度，而"
"唯一能消掉它的项，是把齿轮的速度输出前馈为 `+kd*v_ref` 。只输出位置的齿"
"轮，就是一个带传动比的滞后发生器。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:149 5fd5eee1e67c413a824713744c1b3d32
msgid "``ElectronicGear.TheSyncErrorIsTheRampLagInBothOfItsTerms``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``ElectronicGear.TheSyncErrorIsTheRampLagInBothOfItsTerms``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:150 d43d98055a6a469f884a8ca6ff229ddf
msgid "**Trust `v_max / psi_f` for the top speed.**"
msgstr ""
"**相信 `v_max / psi_f` 给出的最高转速。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:151 3675698158ac46a1abd5a48a511a5370
msgid ""
"It over-promises by about 4 %: the d-axis drop `we*Lq*iq` is part of the "
"bus too. At 24 V and this nameplate the naive ceiling is **2910 rad/s "
"electrical** and the machine's own steady state reaches **2794**, and "
"weakening by `id = -2 A` lifts it to **3320** -- a factor of **1.188**, "
"not the 1.202 the flux ratio promises, because the weakening current's "
"own d-axis voltage eats part of the margin it buys. Both numbers come "
"from bisecting the voltage that holds the operating point, not from a "
"datasheet."
msgstr ""
"它多承诺了约 4 %：d 轴的压降 `we*Lq*iq` 也占母线的一份。在 24 V 和这份铭"
"牌下，朴素的上限是 **2910 rad/s 电角速度** ，而电机自身的稳态到达 **2794"
"** ；按 `id = -2 A` 弱磁把它抬到 **3320** ——是 **1.188** 倍，不是磁链比"
"承诺的 1.202 倍，因为弱磁电流自己的 d 轴电压吃掉了它所换来的一部分余量。"
"两个数都来自对维持工作点的电压做二分，不是来自数据手册。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:156 6561b11b877941d0a502814e63a9ba2c
msgid "``HighSpeed.TheVoltageCeilingIsFourPercentBelowTheNaiveRatioAndWeakeningLiftsIt``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``"
"HighSpeed.TheVoltageCeilingIsFourPercentBelowTheNaiveRatioAndWeakeningLiftsIt"
"``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:157 b9b3352071834d1a8ee8c8d5ce1c5168
msgid ""
"**Read the open-loop flux observer's angle at speed without knowing its "
"bias.**"
msgstr ""
"**在不知道偏置的情况下读开环磁链观测器在高速下的角度。**"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:158 acea3b7d3fb842c29871204806d7066b
msgid ""
"Seeded and fed correctly it still carries a **0.12 rad mean error at 200 "
"rad/s electrical and 0.08 at 600** -- a bias, not a sampling effect, "
"which is why it is not speed-proportional and why the number has to be "
"measured for the machine in front of you rather than assumed small. What "
"*is* speed-independent at a fixed samples-per-cycle ratio and degrades "
"4.7x when the ratio drops from 40 to 8 is the sampling error on top of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"种子与输入都正确时，它仍然带着 **电角速度 200 rad/s 下 0.12 rad 的平均误"
"差、600 rad/s 下 0.08** ——这是偏置，不是采样效应，所以它不与转速成比例，"
"也因此这个数必须针对眼前的电机量出来，而不能假定它很小。与转速无关的、在"
"固定的每周期采样数下保持不变、而当该比值从 40 降到 8 时恶化 4.7 倍的东西"
"，是叠加在其上的采样误差。"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:162 4b785561d20545afa2ba06f034967b07
msgid "``HighSpeed.TheErrorFollowsSamplesPerCycleRatherThanTheSpeed``"
msgstr ""
"用例 ``HighSpeed.TheErrorFollowsSamplesPerCycleRatherThanTheSpeed``"

#: ../../source/boundaries.rst:164 b19df9bfc08641688072827c0b4770f0
msgid ""
"What is *not* on this page, because it is enforced by a gate rather than "
"by a test case: no exceptions, no RTTI, no `new`/`delete`, no "
"`std::vector`/`std::string`, C++17 and C11 only (`strict`), every "
"installed header carrying a README claim row (`claims`), and every number"
" in the documentation matching an artefact the build produced (`docs`)."
msgstr ""
"本页 *没有* 列出、因为它由门禁而不是用例强制的内容：不用异常、不用 RTTI"
"、不用 `new` /`delete` 、不用 `std::vector` /`std::string` ，只用 C++17"
"与 C11（ `strict` ），每个安装出去的头文件都带一行 README 主张（ `claims"
"` ），文档里的每个数都对得上构建产出的产物（ `docs` ）。"

